<section>
  <h2>How our quotes work</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>You submit this form.</strong> We receive your phone, email, location and rough requirements.</li>
    <li><strong>We call within one working day.</strong> Quick discovery: site type, shifts, guard count, special needs.</li>
    <li><strong>Free on-site assessment.</strong> A supervisor visits, walks the site, meets your facility manager. No obligation.</li>
    <li><strong>Written proposal in 24 hours.</strong> Deployment plan, guard mix, pricing breakdown, statutory contributions itemised, SLA.</li>
    <li><strong>Contract & deployment.</strong> Once signed, trained guards on post within 24–72 hours.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>What "all-inclusive" means in our pricing</h2>
  <p>Our published per-guard rate already includes everything required to keep that guard legally and safely on your post:</p>
  <ul class="check-list">
    <li>Basic wage (compliant with the West Bengal minimum wage notification for security services)</li>
    <li>EPF (employer contribution) and administrative charges</li>
    <li>ESI (employer contribution)</li>
    <li>Statutory bonus provisioning</li>
    <li>Gratuity provisioning</li>
    <li>ID card</li>
    <li>Basic equipment (whistle, torch, baton)</li>
    <li>Supervisor visits and replacement guarantee</li>
    <li>Our service margin</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-small text-muted">Additional billing applies for: weapons and armed-guard licences, dogs and handlers, vehicles for patrol units, CCTV monitoring contracts, executive-protection details, and specialised equipment (metal detectors, scanners, body-worn cameras).</p>
</section>
